<topic id="http-shell-bg-stdio">
  <title>Start a background process</title>
  <body>
    <p>Start the process:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "console.log('Preview ready'); setInterval(() =&gt; {}, 1000)"</codeblock>
    <p>Stop it when you're done.</p>
  </body>
